OL,3,GNEWSA'We caught a family hiding plastic
OL,4,Ain their bread'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We had a family who planted plastic in
OL,7,Ftheir piece of bread and then pretended
OL,8,Fthey had chipped their tooth biting
OL,9,Finto it," said Nina Maclean from
OL,10,FMackerel Sky Seafood Bar in the town in
OL,11,Frecent years.
OL,13,FAs well as capturing customers on CCTV
OL,14,Fplanting objects like plastic and hair
OL,15,Fin their food, others have run away
OL,16,Fwithout paying.
